1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:03,100
The Lucky One Who Knows How To Have Fun

2
00:00:03,334 --> 00:00:05,421
I already told you, Jun...

3
00:00:05,421 --> 00:00:07,732
My car center doesn't repair airplanes!

4
00:00:07,732 --> 00:00:12,090
I didn't come here to ask you to repair him! I only came by to introduce you to my new friend...

5
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:15,557
I'm fitted with a supersonic engine capable of reaching Mach 7.

6
00:00:15,557 --> 00:00:18,121
Meaning, I'm not the sort of machine you can just hand over to some local mechanic at a backwater workshop.

7
00:00:18,121 --> 00:00:18,879
Hey!

8
00:00:18,879 --> 00:00:20,018
GET THIS GUY OUTTA MY SIGHT AND SCRAM!

9
00:00:20,018 --> 00:00:20,809
WAAGH!!

10
00:00:21,109 --> 00:00:23,836
Jeez, Uncle Edd. He's been so petty lately.

11
00:00:23,836 --> 00:00:27,611
Maybe he's just tired of dealing with Wild Cardbots after the Tigun incident.

12
00:00:27,611 --> 00:00:29,282
What?! Why?! Why am I the problem now?! Erp-

13
00:00:29,282 --> 00:00:34,488
But from what I've heard, it seems your Metal Cardbots have already given that repairman quite a hard time.

14
00:00:34,488 --> 00:00:36,762
So to blame it on us is a bit much, don't you think?

15
00:00:36,762 --> 00:00:38,427
Ah, I can't exactly deny that...

16
00:00:38,427 --> 00:00:41,243
Still, did you really have to put it that way, Night Griffon?

17
00:00:41,243 --> 00:00:44,328
I'm not the type to tell a lie. You'll just have to deal with it!

18
00:00:44,328 --> 00:00:45,472
This guy's annoying!

19
00:00:45,472 --> 00:00:46,607
Jun!

20
00:00:46,607 --> 00:00:48,220
Vera! And... Mr. Jim?

21
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,386
Knew you'd be here. Hey there, sparrow.

22
00:00:50,386 --> 00:00:51,505
Spa- WHAT?!

23
00:00:51,505 --> 00:00:52,524
What brings you here?

24
00:00:52,524 --> 00:00:54,326
Jun, take a look at this!

25
00:00:54,326 --> 00:00:56,439
Strange graffiti has appeared all over town!

26
00:00:56,439 --> 00:00:58,222
Don't you think the shape looks suspicious?

27
00:00:58,222 --> 00:01:00,006
I dunno. It just looks like someone's playing pranks.

28
00:01:00,006 --> 00:01:01,950
No way, it's more than just a prank!

29
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:05,222
This is footage from the CCTV at the parking lot. See that?

30
00:01:05,222 --> 00:01:05,816
Hm?

31
00:01:05,816 --> 00:01:08,382
Now, rewind this a little bit and... Look!

32
00:01:09,081 --> 00:01:11,587
Just by its size and appearance, doesn't it look like a Metal Cardbot?

33
00:01:11,587 --> 00:01:13,444
This is a Wild Cardbot.

34
00:01:13,444 --> 00:01:15,057
Oh! It's one of them again?

35
00:01:15,057 --> 00:01:17,888
That's the emblem of the Rapid tribe, which symbolizes the hunters of the plains.

36
00:01:17,888 --> 00:01:20,484
Never thought I'd see them again in a place like this! Hahahaha!

37
00:01:20,484 --> 00:01:22,490
I knew it was the right call to come looking for you!

38
00:01:22,490 --> 00:01:24,766
They might be trying to send us some sort of message through these symbols.

39
00:01:24,766 --> 00:01:27,688
Mr. Jim, please take us to where these photos were taken.

40
00:01:27,688 --> 00:01:28,487
Ah- Of course!

41
00:01:28,487 --> 00:01:30,528
Doodles... How trivial.

42
00:01:31,781 --> 00:01:34,968
Alright. Turn right here, then go straight, and then we'll be there.

43
00:01:34,968 --> 00:01:36,009
Yes, sir!

44
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:41,151
Huh? Since when has this road been closed to traffic? Guess we have no choice but to go around.

45
00:01:41,914 --> 00:01:44,049
Hm? This road is blocked as well!

46
00:01:46,659 --> 00:01:47,632
Wh- what's going on?

47
00:01:47,632 --> 00:01:51,195
Kyahahaha! "Wh-wHaT's GoInG oN?" Hehaha!

48
00:01:51,195 --> 00:01:55,259
Roads are blocked all around ya! Weird, right? Whatcha gonna do? Gonna sprout wings and fly or somethin'? Hahahahaha!

49
00:01:55,259 --> 00:01:56,472
Who's there? Show yourself!

50
00:01:56,472 --> 00:01:57,173
Uh?

51
00:01:57,724 --> 00:01:58,111
Nyan!

52
00:01:58,111 --> 00:01:58,700
Woah!

53
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,341
Blue Cop!

54
00:01:59,341 --> 00:01:59,826
WAH-!!

55
00:02:00,483 --> 00:02:03,852
Huehuehuehue. Ya wanna know? Should I show myself or not? Show ya or not? Or show ya not?

56
00:02:03,852 --> 00:02:06,266
I'm feelin' extra generous today, so big sis will go easy on ya!

57
00:02:06,266 --> 00:02:07,481
Here I am!

58
00:02:07,867 --> 00:02:09,349
Wh-Who the heck are you?!

59
00:02:09,349 --> 00:02:13,846
Hello, everybody! The name's Tachy! My life's motto is “Let's have fun 'til the very end!”

60
00:02:13,846 --> 00:02:17,917
People of Mowtown, are you all having fun tonight too??? Hahahaha! Hahahahaha!

61
00:02:17,917 --> 00:02:19,530
What's that bot been eating?

62
00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:21,729
Tachy! So it was you who doodled all over town!

63
00:02:21,729 --> 00:02:22,793
Jeez louise.

64
00:02:22,793 --> 00:02:26,754
Ay Star Guardian, are your eyes growing out of your butt, or what? How the hay are those doodles? That's my name!

65
00:02:26,754 --> 00:02:28,537
Y'see?! It's Tachy, 'kay? Tachy!

66
00:02:28,537 --> 00:02:29,728
Those were autographs?!

67
00:02:29,728 --> 00:02:31,158
This is the photo op!

68
00:02:31,158 --> 00:02:32,000
Wow!~

69
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,365
Cool toy y'got there, uncle!

70
00:02:33,365 --> 00:02:34,085
My camera!

71
00:02:34,085 --> 00:02:35,126
Give that back to its owner!

72
00:02:35,626 --> 00:02:40,637
Nuh uh! Say cheese! C'maaan, 'luecop. It's like you're not even tryin'! You're makin' me yawn!

73
00:02:40,637 --> 00:02:41,307
You know me? 

74
00:02:41,307 --> 00:02:44,944
You'd have to be living under a rock not to know who you are. You're a star, Bluey! A star! 

75
00:02:44,944 --> 00:02:45,852
How does she do that?

76
00:02:45,852 --> 00:02:49,938
She's a hunter, after all. She hunts down her prey before anyone even knows what happened.

77
00:02:49,938 --> 00:02:50,741
Aha!

78
00:02:50,741 --> 00:02:52,781
I know her better than anyone. Lemme catch her!

79
00:02:52,781 --> 00:02:54,807
Okay. I'll leave it to you!

80
00:02:54,807 --> 00:02:58,002
Huh? That you, Gunny? Whattya doin' with Bluey here?

81
00:02:58,002 --> 00:03:00,229
Oi, heya, Tachy. I ain't too sure myself.

82
00:03:00,229 --> 00:03:02,108
You won't be able to escape my fangs this time!

83
00:03:02,108 --> 00:03:04,462
Aaaaah, yeah yeah. Then catch me if ya can!

84
00:03:04,462 --> 00:03:05,420
You little-!!

85
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:06,194
Agh!

86
00:03:06,556 --> 00:03:08,871
Yahoo! That's gotta hurt!

87
00:03:08,871 --> 00:03:12,472
You can't solve every problem in this world with your fists, Tigun!

88
00:03:12,472 --> 00:03:16,247
Hehahaha! What the heck is that on your head? That look really suits ya! Huhaha-

89
00:03:16,247 --> 00:03:17,086
That look suits you, too.

90
00:03:17,086 --> 00:03:17,581
Eh?

91
00:03:17,581 --> 00:03:21,187
Nyahahahaha! They look just like BFFs! I totally nailed it, huh?

92
00:03:21,187 --> 00:03:22,825
She's playing with them like they're toys.

93
00:03:22,825 --> 00:03:24,865
You're not being much of a help, Tigun!

94
00:03:24,865 --> 00:03:28,014
Ehehehe! Isn't it annoying? Isn't it crazy? Does it make ya mad?

95
00:03:28,014 --> 00:03:28,943
Oh. Thanks for this!

96
00:03:29,485 --> 00:03:32,629
If you're really annoyed and want me to stop, then you'll have to catch me first!

97
00:03:32,629 --> 00:03:34,295
Tch! We're not letting you get away!

98
00:03:47,163 --> 00:03:47,550
Where did she go?

99
00:03:47,550 --> 00:03:49,098
Here I am! Lookie here!

100
00:03:49,536 --> 00:03:50,498
Watch it!

101
00:03:53,432 --> 00:03:54,359
Coming through!

102
00:03:54,889 --> 00:03:56,391
Oh my, Mr. 'luecop! Fancy seein' you here!

103
00:03:56,391 --> 00:04:01,294
How ya doin' these days? Didja go to the car wash? You're lookin' super clean!

104
00:04:01,294 --> 00:04:04,918
Hooooo! This is getting boring. Isn't it past your bedtime?

105
00:04:04,918 --> 00:04:06,306
Get back to your house before it gets dark~!

106
00:04:07,918 --> 00:04:08,894
She's gone!

107
00:04:08,894 --> 00:04:10,693
How is any of this even possible??

108
00:04:10,693 --> 00:04:12,986
Looks like she must be using stealth mode.

109
00:04:12,986 --> 00:04:14,125
Stealth mode?

110
00:04:14,125 --> 00:04:17,961
It's an ability that can make someone turn invisible, just like Shadow X and Flash Vector can.

111
00:04:17,961 --> 00:04:21,268
Although when I fought those two, I could still see their shadows when they disappeared,

112
00:04:21,268 --> 00:04:22,872
so I was able to figure out where they were. But now...

113
00:04:22,872 --> 00:04:24,901
That assumption is wrong, Jun. 

114
00:04:24,901 --> 00:04:25,932
Soleil?

115
00:04:25,932 --> 00:04:29,396
Tachy didn't conceal her appearance. She simply moved at super-high speed. 

116
00:04:29,396 --> 00:04:30,120
What?

117
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,262
How'd you figure that out?

118
00:04:31,262 --> 00:04:34,163
She saw it all. Tachy's movements, that is.

119
00:04:34,163 --> 00:04:34,951
She saw all that?

120
00:04:34,951 --> 00:04:36,942
Yes. Every single movement.

121
00:04:36,942 --> 00:04:38,819
You've got some superhuman dynamic vision!

122
00:04:38,819 --> 00:04:41,507
Even if you can see her every move, it's pointless unless you can catch her.

123
00:04:41,507 --> 00:04:43,096
We'll have to figure that part out now.

124
00:04:43,096 --> 00:04:46,487
But thanks to you guys, we at least learned we can't just chase her tail all day.

125
00:04:46,487 --> 00:04:48,677
So you were just standing around watching us that whole time?!

126
00:04:48,677 --> 00:04:49,834
Yes, Editor-in-Chief!

127
00:04:49,834 --> 00:04:51,860
Where the heck are you right now, Jim?!

128
00:04:51,860 --> 00:04:53,487
A multi-vehicle rollover accident just happened!!

129
00:04:53,487 --> 00:04:54,793
Eh- What?!

130
00:04:55,564 --> 00:04:57,240
He said the cars on the road are suddenly flipping over...

131
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:58,863
Could Tachy be behind this?

132
00:04:59,163 --> 00:04:59,870
Eh??

133
00:05:02,093 --> 00:05:04,048
What on earth happened here?!

134
00:05:04,048 --> 00:05:05,846
Don't tell me... Tachy did all this??

135
00:05:05,846 --> 00:05:08,925
It's all thanks to that explosive speed she generates in an instant!

136
00:05:08,925 --> 00:05:10,706
There's no doubt she could do all this with the help of the Wild Power!

137
00:05:10,706 --> 00:05:11,980
You mean her Weapon Card, right?

138
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:13,476
Let's help everyone first!

139
00:05:13,476 --> 00:05:14,711
Yeah!

140
00:05:14,711 --> 00:05:17,235
Jun! Blue Cop!

141
00:05:17,634 --> 00:05:18,999
Mega Trucker!

142
00:05:20,028 --> 00:05:21,069
Thanks.

143
00:05:21,069 --> 00:05:26,911
Actually, I could've moved something this heavy all by myself. But y'know, people might get hurt and all...

144
00:05:26,911 --> 00:05:29,430
Oh! You're that Blahblah guy, right?

145
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,382
Blaion.

146
00:05:30,382 --> 00:05:32,718
Let's leave the introductions for later. We need to help these people!

147
00:05:32,718 --> 00:05:34,064
Whatcha doin'? Not planning on goin' home yet?

148
00:05:34,064 --> 00:05:35,040
Waaugh!

149
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,707
Tachy!

150
00:05:35,707 --> 00:05:39,122
Stop this already! You're putting people in danger! Why are you doing this?

151
00:05:39,122 --> 00:05:40,951
You're sooo serious it's scary.

152
00:05:40,951 --> 00:05:47,082
Wanna know why? ‘Cause it's fun! I feel sooo sorry for you guys who live such booooring lives! Boohoohoo...

153
00:05:47,082 --> 00:05:50,882
On the other hand! I, who knows how to have fun, am the lucky one! Nyaha! Nyahahaha!

154
00:05:50,882 --> 00:05:55,992
Ghhhh... Soleil, you said you can see her every move, right? Do something already!

155
00:05:55,992 --> 00:05:59,651
Alright. Blaion, Set Up! Do not use fire in this area.

156
00:05:59,651 --> 00:06:00,560
I know.

157
00:06:00,795 --> 00:06:04,036
Who's this? Never seen you before. Salutations~

158
00:06:04,036 --> 00:06:05,911
I'm nothing like their kind!

159
00:06:05,911 --> 00:06:07,684
Do you remember asking?~

160
00:06:07,684 --> 00:06:16,245
Kyahahaha! Gotcha! You seem like a pretty bold and hot-tempered guy, so I'll treat you to a spe~cial showcase of my Wild Po~wer!

161
00:06:17,356 --> 00:06:18,810
Sound good?

162
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:19,898
Suit yourself!

163
00:06:19,898 --> 00:06:20,819
I will!

164
00:06:22,247 --> 00:06:23,326
Lemme help ya up!

165
00:06:24,036 --> 00:06:24,576
Nyaha!

166
00:06:24,576 --> 00:06:25,653
You little-!!

167
00:06:29,975 --> 00:06:31,199
Nice view, wasn't it?

168
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:36,819
Behind you!

169
00:06:38,673 --> 00:06:39,987
Blaion! What are you doing?!

170
00:06:39,987 --> 00:06:41,637
I slashed right when you gave the signal!

171
00:06:41,637 --> 00:06:43,552
Yeah, I can confirm that. Let's try it again!

172
00:06:47,331 --> 00:06:47,930
Up!

173
00:06:49,449 --> 00:06:50,430
You're too slow!

174
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:52,021
It's your orders that are too slow!

175
00:06:52,021 --> 00:06:54,433
See? It doesn't matter if you can see her movements.

176
00:06:54,433 --> 00:06:56,191
It's useless if his attacks don't land!

177
00:06:56,191 --> 00:06:58,026
How the heck are we supposed to deal with her, then?!

178
00:06:58,026 --> 00:06:59,935
Ugh... this is no fun at all.

179
00:06:59,935 --> 00:07:00,732
Whatchu say?!

180
00:07:00,732 --> 00:07:02,259
I said it's no fun!

181
00:07:02,259 --> 00:07:07,286
If we're gonna compete, we should at least match up fighters in the same weight class! A match where one side has a clear advantage isn't any fun!

182
00:07:07,286 --> 00:07:09,019
You sayin' I don't know what fun is?!

183
00:07:09,019 --> 00:07:15,177
A fistfight between the brawny, an aerial battle between those with wings, a race between speedsters! That's what fun battles are all about! Understand?!

184
00:07:15,177 --> 00:07:15,983
Nyaa...!

185
00:07:16,636 --> 00:07:17,718
She was actually upset by that!

186
00:07:17,718 --> 00:07:22,704
He hurt her pride. A Wild Cardbot can't hide its competitive instinct, after all.

187
00:07:22,704 --> 00:07:23,446
Really..?

188
00:07:23,446 --> 00:07:26,882
I'd say that the fairest competition for two bots who are so different should be...

189
00:07:26,882 --> 00:07:29,817
A dance battle! Hee-hee!

190
00:07:29,817 --> 00:07:31,846
Dance... battle...?

191
00:07:31,846 --> 00:07:33,860
SOUNDS FUN!!!

192
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:34,875
Letsgoletsgoletsgoletsgo!!

193
00:07:34,875 --> 00:07:38,201
I'll handle the judging along with the members of the Mowtown Dance Club.

194
00:07:38,201 --> 00:07:40,826
The winner gets to ask the loser for whatever they want! How does that sound?

195
00:07:40,826 --> 00:07:41,843
I'm in!

196
00:07:41,843 --> 00:07:43,057
She's all for it.

197
00:07:43,057 --> 00:07:44,389
A peaceful solution, I like it!

198
00:07:44,389 --> 00:07:46,327
I used to be a pretty good dancer, too.

199
00:07:46,327 --> 00:07:48,860
Very well. Alright, Blaion, we're going to dance-

200
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:49,920
Absolutely not!

201
00:07:51,305 --> 00:07:53,783
Dancing is the only way to stop Tachy. Listen to me!

202
00:07:53,783 --> 00:07:56,247
I will never dance! Never.

203
00:07:58,096 --> 00:07:59,024
What a letdown.

204
00:07:59,024 --> 00:08:00,944
And you call yourself a Wild Cardbot warrior?

205
00:08:00,944 --> 00:08:03,964
Even a Star Guardian, which is the very epitome of fuddy-duddy, knows how to dance!

206
00:08:03,964 --> 00:08:05,024
It's a little embarrassing, though...

207
00:08:05,024 --> 00:08:07,019
So no dance battle?

208
00:08:07,019 --> 00:08:08,697
Hm... If that's the case...

209
00:08:08,697 --> 00:08:10,365
Then how about a battle with this guy?

210
00:08:10,365 --> 00:08:12,230
Hm? Are you asking me to dance?

211
00:08:12,230 --> 00:08:14,247
Nope. We're going to race!

212
00:08:14,247 --> 00:08:15,439
A race?

213
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:20,305
Mega Trucker is right. It's only fun when speedsters compete against other speedsters. Right?

214
00:08:20,305 --> 00:08:23,360
Hm-hm. You're not wrong. You certainly know what you're talking about.

215
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:27,959
Nya-hahahaha! Y'think you can beat me in a game of speed? You're hilarious!

216
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:29,841
Alright! Let's have a showdown!

217
00:08:29,841 --> 00:08:31,632
Tch. A dance battle is way better.

218
00:08:31,632 --> 00:08:34,114
At least you stopped her reckless behavior.

219
00:08:34,114 --> 00:08:36,195
Blaion... What am I to you?

220
00:08:36,195 --> 00:08:37,883
Forgive me, Soleil...

221
00:08:37,883 --> 00:08:41,888
This place is far too narrow to show off our speed. Shall we move somewhere else?

222
00:08:41,888 --> 00:08:42,936
Works for me!

223
00:08:42,936 --> 00:08:44,461
Who's gonna stay and clean up this mess?

224
00:08:44,461 --> 00:08:47,059
Ugh. I'll clean it up. You guys go on without me.

225
00:08:47,059 --> 00:08:49,332
Thank you! But where should we go?

226
00:08:49,332 --> 00:08:52,256
If it's a race we're talking about... I know just the place!

227
00:08:52,256 --> 00:08:55,374
Nya~hahaha! Just lookin' at it makes me feel SO refreshed!

228
00:08:55,374 --> 00:08:57,640
This is Route 77, which crosses the entire continent!

229
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,806
I never thought Mega Trucker would know a road like this.

230
00:08:59,806 --> 00:09:01,866
He said all truckers need to know this route.

231
00:09:01,866 --> 00:09:04,342
A perfect place for a showdown of speed.

232
00:09:04,342 --> 00:09:05,624
What are the conditions for victory?

233
00:09:05,624 --> 00:09:10,080
The one who reaches that mountain in the distance and returns here is the winner.

234
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,274
Tachy. If you lose, you're coming with us.

235
00:09:12,274 --> 00:09:14,625
Alright! Alrighty alrighty. Let's start!

236
00:09:14,625 --> 00:09:15,327
Jun?

237
00:09:15,327 --> 00:09:16,057
Yep!

238
00:09:16,157 --> 00:09:17,820
Night Griffon! Set Up!

239
00:09:30,541 --> 00:09:33,326
You sure about this, though? Is that sparrow really fast enough?

240
00:09:33,326 --> 00:09:37,534
Night Griffon said his maximum speed is Mach 7, which is supersonic speed. It's worth a try.

241
00:09:37,534 --> 00:09:41,414
But Tachy's no pushover either. She's much lighter than him and moves so fast she becomes invisible to the naked eye!

242
00:09:41,815 --> 00:09:42,883
Ready!

243
00:09:46,164 --> 00:09:47,366
Nya!!

244
00:09:48,296 --> 00:09:49,668
Tachy is overwhelmingly fast, as expected!

245
00:09:49,668 --> 00:09:50,952
He'll catch up soon enough.

246
00:09:50,952 --> 00:09:52,124
Phantom Hornet, do you see them?

247
00:09:52,124 --> 00:09:55,802
Yeah. Tachy is speeding far ahead. It'll be hard to catch up with her.

248
00:09:55,802 --> 00:09:58,081
Nyahahahahaha! How ya like that, huh? Huh?

249
00:09:58,081 --> 00:10:00,984
Hmhmhmhm. The game has only just begun!

250
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:08,070
Bzzt! Tachy suddenly slowed down!

251
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:10,121
- Excuse me.
- Nyan!!

252
00:10:10,221 --> 00:10:12,856
Night Griffon overtook Tachy!

253
00:10:12,856 --> 00:10:13,712
Way to go!

254
00:10:14,470 --> 00:10:15,644
Nyaaaaaa...

255
00:10:15,644 --> 00:10:18,918
Nya nya!! See?? You're no match for me!!

256
00:10:18,918 --> 00:10:22,274
Oh-ho. You're fast indeed. But will you be able to hold that speed much longer?

257
00:10:22,274 --> 00:10:23,788
Tachy overtook him again!

258
00:10:23,788 --> 00:10:24,673
No way!

259
00:10:24,673 --> 00:10:25,875
Was it hopeless after all?

260
00:10:25,875 --> 00:10:27,207
Nah. We still stand a chance!

261
00:10:27,207 --> 00:10:27,754
Really?

262
00:10:27,754 --> 00:10:30,485
I told ya. Tachy's speed is for an instant.

263
00:10:30,485 --> 00:10:33,504
Running such a long distance while exerting that much force is too much to handle, even for her.

264
00:10:35,315 --> 00:10:37,773
Wouldn't it be better not to push yourself too hard?

265
00:10:37,773 --> 00:10:39,940
Nyahaha! You're the one who needs rest!

266
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:45,080
- NYAAAAAAAAAAA!!
- CAAAAAAAAAAAW!!

267
00:10:45,379 --> 00:10:51,273
Miss, your body can't take any more of this. Admit defeat and join the master of the Metal Breath.

268
00:10:51,273 --> 00:10:52,349
What?

269
00:10:52,349 --> 00:10:57,224
But that would mean... I won't be able to run around all I want, or play games anymore!

270
00:10:57,224 --> 00:10:59,437
That is our fate.

271
00:10:59,437 --> 00:11:01,750
That kinda life... is no fun at all!!

272
00:11:02,905 --> 00:11:04,504
I don't wanna!!!

273
00:11:08,836 --> 00:11:13,062
I never wanna see your faces ever agaiiin!! Waaaaah!!

274
00:11:13,254 --> 00:11:14,760
Night Griffon crashed!

275
00:11:15,660 --> 00:11:16,083
What??

276
00:11:16,083 --> 00:11:17,158
Let's go get him quickly.

277
00:11:21,631 --> 00:11:22,645
Are you okay, Night Griffon?

278
00:11:22,645 --> 00:11:24,833
Hm-hm. We were unable to settle the match.

279
00:11:24,833 --> 00:11:25,634
Where did Tachy go?

280
00:11:25,634 --> 00:11:29,059
Who knows? She just ran off, crying and wailing.

281
00:11:29,059 --> 00:11:31,885
It seems she doesn't want to be friends with you just yet, Jun.

282
00:11:32,784 --> 00:11:34,091
Tachy...

